# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR[[cite:obs-b8e2b5aaecacf6215355b3533123cf54d13b48ee "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]]. Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director[[cite:obs-cc29f1e2c86a12528a601fe165acba8ab3f800f1 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
